{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STUMP is a <strong>moving</strong> <strong>Tower Defense</strong> game. Cross the maze while facing waves of <strong>creatures</strong> determined to devour you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/extras/e3da73ee7cd19cd2cda335a4b7c70465.avif?t=1765731731\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Stump</strong>, protecting <strong>Lucile</strong>: a strange creature determined to bind her fate to yours. You share your health points and advance together, room by room, fighting the creatures along your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/extras/0e7436fb40fa903579e20c3f881fc818.avif?t=1765731731\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you, you are accompanied by <strong>war sticks</strong> that must be placed strategically during battles. Upgrade them and learn their synergies to carve a path through this ruined realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/extras/615651b8c0484b76b293152d63ef2215.avif?t=1765731731\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping this labyrinth will not be easy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715310?t=1765731731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/ec36702fab2a82b18dbc25adc4764dd6c44b822b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765731731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715310/f58f7eff0d98d72080e2d841640ac66c0d90fc3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765731731","capsul